{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/101245","id":2264677975,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6G_D5X","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101245","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101245.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101245.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101245","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/101245/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/101245/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101245/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/69e2c1727d0174405575f788b22fde7517cd8efd","number":101245,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Fix changing physics interpolation in SceneTree at runtime","user":{"login":"KeyboardDanni","id":34800072,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM0ODAwMDcy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/34800072?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KeyboardDanni","html_url":"https://github.com/KeyboardDanni","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KeyboardDanni/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KeyboardDanni/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KeyboardDanni/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KeyboardDanni/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KeyboardDanni/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KeyboardDanni/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KeyboardDanni/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KeyboardDanni/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KeyboardDanni/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Fixes #101192\r\nFixes #101195\r\n\r\nIf physics interpolation is disabled, newly created and updated objects don't update their interpolation data, which can cause severe problems if the setting is enabled globally via `SceneTree::set_physics_interpolation_enabled()` at runtime. This PR adds a notification, `NOTIFICATION_TREE_PHYSICS_INTERPOLATION_CHANGED`, which is used to perform a full interpolation reset on the nodes in the tree regardless of their visibility. Since `SceneTree::set_physics_interpolation_enabled()` is likely to only be called when changing in-game graphics settings, the performance cost of updating everything shouldn't be an issue. The existing physics interpolation reset functionality is unaffected.\r\n\r\nThis PR also fixes the camera no longer updating after `SceneTree::set_physics_interpolation_enabled()` is called.","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":370471880,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzNzA0NzE4ODA=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:physics","name":"topic:physics","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2025-01-07T20:56:49Z","updated_at":"2025-02-11T09:11:38Z","closed_at":"2025-02-11T08:49:46Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"67bafa972ecbaf55279fb52f463e49413e3c33de","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[{"login":"lawnjelly","id":21999379,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxOTk5Mzc5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/21999379?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.g